WEBVTT

00:00:02.115 --> 00:00:09.881
Plan builder drafts a schedule towards your race.

00:00:09.931 --> 00:00:14.028
Pick a race or add a new one: name and date.

00:00:14.078 --> 00:00:17.419
Choose the sport and the distance.

00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:21.357
Set how many hours a week you can train.

00:00:21.407 --> 00:00:27.512
Tick your rest day(s).

00:00:27.562 --> 00:00:33.230
You get a draft: review it and adopt it when it fits.
